      <h2>Shipping</h2>
      <p>We ship from our Portland, Oregon studio. Most orders are processed within 1–2 business days.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal" style="margin-top:40px">
      <h3>Domestic shipping (US)</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Standard (3–5 business days):</strong> Complimentary on orders over $75. $8 on orders under $75.</li>
        <li><strong>Expedited (1–2 business days):</strong> $18</li>
        <li><strong>Overnight:</strong> $32</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal" style="margin-top:40px">
      <h3>International shipping</h3>
      <p>We ship to most countries worldwide. Rates and delivery times vary by destination. Customers are responsible for any customs duties or import taxes.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Canada & Mexico (5–10 business days):</strong> Starting at $18</li>
        <li><strong>Europe & UK (7–14 business days):</strong> Starting at $28</li>
        <li><strong>Rest of world (10–21 business days):</strong> Starting at $38</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal" style="margin-top:64px">
      <h2>Returns</h2>
      <p>We want you to love what you receive.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Unopened items:</strong> Return within 30 days of delivery for a full refund.</li>
        <li><strong>Damaged items:</strong> Email us within 7 days of delivery with photos. We'll replace it immediately.</li>
        <li><strong>Opened candles:</strong> Cannot be returned for hygiene reasons, but please reach out if there's an issue.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To initiate a return, email <a href="mailto:hello@auraandoak.com">hello@auraandoak.com</a> with your order number.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
